      "function": "guard_tail",
      "anchor": "if self.hp > 0 then",
      "condition": "self.hp > 0 (age) / self.hp <= 0 or expired",
      "semantic": "A guard dies when its hp is spent or its lifetime has run out; it ages only while it still has hp, and it expires on the act AFTER its count passes 0 (lifetime read before the decrement < 0), i.e. it lives lifetime+1 acts.",
      "arms": [
        {
          "when": "hp > 0 and old lifetime >= 0",
          "observable": "lifetime -1, alive",
          "asserted": true
        },
        {
          "when": "hp > 0 and old lifetime < 0",
          "observable": "dead",
          "asserted": false
        },
        {
          "when": "hp <= 0",
          "observable": "dead without ageing",
          "asserted": true
        }
      ],
      "setting": "none",
      "status": "executed-only",
      "tests": [
        {
          "file": "tests/integration/test_effect_act.cpp",
          "test": "EffectAct.magic_shield_orbit_step_and_ageing"
        },
        {
          "file": "tests/integration/test_effect_more_paths.cpp",
          "test": "EffectMorePaths.effect_batch3_guard_dies_when_collisions_drain_its_hitpoints"
        }
      ],
      "missing_arms": [],
      "note": [
        "Ageing arm (lifetime 100 -> 99, alive; lifetime 5 -> 4) and hp<=0 arm (dies without ageing, lifetime stays 0) asserted; the expiry arm (hp > 0, old lifetime < 0 -> dead; note the off-by-one: a shield set to lifetime 0 lives one more act) is unasserted."
